        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "Ask whether it is allowed",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Use 可以 to ask for or give permission. It can also mean something is possible in context; it is not the same as knowing a skill.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我可以去学校吗？",
                "pinyin": "wǒ kěyǐ qù xuéxiào ma ？",
                "meaning": "May I go to school?",
                "audio": "6c2b31b4c2ed870bac89d23e8d99adda5e0c440307b5abe506f8690ab0d4de7f"
              },
              {
                "text": "你可以去学校。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ kěyǐ qù xuéxiào 。",
